[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    145[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The house has 3 floors, 5 bedrooms, and 3.5 bathrooms
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    146[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The house has 3 floors, 5 bedrooms, and 3.5 bathrooms
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    147[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The house has 3 floors, 5 bedrooms, and 3.5 bathrooms
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    148[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The house has 4 floors, 5 bedrooms, and 3.5 bathrooms
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    149[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The house has 4 floors, 5 bedrooms, and 4.5 bathrooms
